
Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Catppuccin for PuTTY / MTPuTTY
; Save as catppuccin-putty.reg and double-click to import on Windows.
; Then open PuTTY → Load a "Catppuccin *" session to apply colors.
; Color slots: 0-1 FG, 2-3 BG, 4-5 Cursor, 6-7 Black, 8-9 Red,
;              10-11 Green, 12-13 Yellow, 14-15 Blue,
;              16-17 Magenta, 18-19 Cyan, 20-21 White

; ──────────────────────────────────────────
;  🌿 Mocha (darkest)
; ──────────────────────────────────────────
[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\SimonTatham\PuTTY\Sessions\Catppuccin%20Mocha]
